  "description": "After the tragic death of their childhood friend, Kang Chung-Woo, Ha Se-Jun, and Eun Bin decide to grant Myung Yu-Hyeon's last wish by performing a séance so they all can hang out for the final time. Much to their surprise, the séance works, and Yu-Hyeon's spirit comes back. But he wasn't exactly honest about his steamy last wish... Now, he has to possess one of his friends to make it come true. Will fulfilling Yu-Hyeon's last lusty desire send him to nirvana? Or does he have even more wishes?!\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Includes eight extra chapters.\n\\- Winner of the 14th Mr.Blue Contest.*",
